From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tomas Pelka <tpelka@redhat.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] systemd: Set KRB5RCACHEDIR to %t/gnome-remote-desktop across
 service units

When authenticating RDP clients via Kerberos NLA, libkrb5 creates a
host replay cache file. By default, it creates /var/tmp/krb5_<UID>.rcache2.
Because system accounts on RHEL 10 are allocated dynamically by sysusers,
the UID of gnome-remote-desktop is not fixed, causing SELinux denials when
attempting to create files in /var/tmp without fixed-name type transitions.

Direct libkrb5 to store replay cache files on tmpfs under
%t/gnome-remote-desktop ($XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/gnome-remote-desktop or
/run/gnome-remote-desktop). This ensures all Kerberos replay caches
remain volatile, behave like /tmp without persisting across reboots,
and are cleaned up automatically on logout or service termination.

Triggered by: https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHEL-246392
Resolves: https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/RHEL-3732
---
 data/gnome-remote-desktop-headless.service.in | 3 +++
 data/gnome-remote-desktop-system.service.in   | 3 +++
 data/gnome-remote-desktop.service.in          | 3 +++
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/data/gnome-remote-desktop-headless.service.in b/data/gnome-remote-desktop-headless.service.in
index a9cb8fe..18f4078 100644
--- a/data/gnome-remote-desktop-headless.service.in
+++ b/data/gnome-remote-desktop-headless.service.in
@@ -5,6 +5,9 @@ Conflicts=gnome-remote-desktop.service
 [Service]
 Type=dbus
 BusName=org.gnome.RemoteDesktop.Headless
+Environment=KRB5RCACHEDIR=%t/gnome-remote-desktop
+RuntimeDirectory=gnome-remote-desktop
+RuntimeDirectoryMode=0700
 ExecStart=@libexecdir@/gnome-remote-desktop-daemon --headless
 Restart=on-failure
 
diff --git a/data/gnome-remote-desktop-system.service.in b/data/gnome-remote-desktop-system.service.in
index 1941d3d..21ce9e1 100644
--- a/data/gnome-remote-desktop-system.service.in
+++ b/data/gnome-remote-desktop-system.service.in
@@ -5,6 +5,9 @@ Description=GNOME Remote Desktop
 Type=dbus
 User=@GRD_USERNAME@
 BusName=org.gnome.RemoteDesktop
+Environment=KRB5RCACHEDIR=%t/gnome-remote-desktop
+RuntimeDirectory=gnome-remote-desktop
+RuntimeDirectoryMode=0700
 ExecStart=@libexecdir@/gnome-remote-desktop-daemon --system
 Restart=on-failure
 
diff --git a/data/gnome-remote-desktop.service.in b/data/gnome-remote-desktop.service.in
index be6ca82..3a75871 100644
--- a/data/gnome-remote-desktop.service.in
+++ b/data/gnome-remote-desktop.service.in
@@ -4,6 +4,9 @@ Description=GNOME Remote Desktop
 [Service]
 Type=dbus
 BusName=org.gnome.RemoteDesktop.User
+Environment=KRB5RCACHEDIR=%t/gnome-remote-desktop
+RuntimeDirectory=gnome-remote-desktop
+RuntimeDirectoryMode=0700
 ExecStart=@libexecdir@/gnome-remote-desktop-daemon
 Restart=on-failure
 
